  <page_number>27</page_number>
  <running_head>Lipsiana Nota</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">Hoc Teuton. gaertoe, garbe, Gallis</l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>gerbe</i>, Latino-barbaris <i>garba:</i> nec longè</l>
    <l n="3">abit Sax. ʒnipe, unde noftrum grtpe,</l>
    <l n="4">eâdem notione.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Hoc Saxon. ʒe-</l>
    <l n="6">opeẹeo, &amp; ʒeopeḥtz.</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">Vide Cl. Spelman. in voce Ber-glum.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">Sculptile, Sax. ʒnapen, nobis hodie graben,</l>
    <l n="9">quemadmodum statua nobis vulgò a</l>
    <l n="10">graben image.</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">Hoc Sax.onʒepnemeo, &amp; unʒepnemeo ;</l>
    <l n="12">voce composita à negandi five privan-</l>
    <l n="13">di particula, on,un, i.e. non,&amp;</l>
    <l n="14">ʒepne-meo, perfectus.</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">Meretrix Saxon.</l>
    <l n="16">hope,nobis (to, voci perperam præpo-</l>
    <l n="17">nentibus)toboze : perperam dico; nam</l>
    <l n="18">ab hypan venit, i.e.precio conducere,</l>
    <l n="19">quod vox etiam Latina sat plane confirmat.</l>
    <l n="20" para="true">Sax. confensus;</l>
  </main_text>
  <marginalia>
    <note side="left" line_from="0" line_to="0">Balico, Subitò.</note>
